---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear()
---

<footer class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-moss/15 bg-ink-950">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pt-16 pb-8 sm:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-10 sm:flex-row">
      <div class="max-w-sm">
        <p class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold italic text-paper">
          Ticka<span class="text-lime">.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper-dim">
          Comprobantes que se procesan solos. De la bandeja de entrada al CSV
          de tu sistema contable, sin tipear.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-paper-mute">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-lime"></span>
          Alfa privada — construyendo en Perú
        </p>
      </div>

      <nav class="flex gap-16" aria-label="Pie de página">
        <div>
          <p class="kicker mb-5 text-[10px]">Producto</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/#producto" class="draw-link text-paper-dim hover:text-paper">Características</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/#como-funciona" class="draw-link text-paper-dim hover:text-paper">Cómo funciona</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/#contacto" class="draw-link text-paper-dim hover:text-paper">Unirse al alfa</a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="kicker mb-5 text-[10px]">Recursos</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/blog/" class="draw-link text-paper-dim hover:text-paper">Novedades</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/rss.xml" class="draw-link text-paper-dim hover:text-paper">RSS</a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-3 border-t border-moss/15 pt-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-paper-mute">
        © {currentYear} Ticka — Todos los derechos reservados
      </p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.14em] text-paper-mute uppercase">
        Hecho en Perú 🇵🇪
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p
    class="pointer-events-none -mb-[0.27em] text-center font-display text-[clamp(6rem,22vw,17rem)] leading-none font-semibold tracking-tight text-moss/10 select-none"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    Ticka
  </p>
</footer>
